## Part 5 — Results so far

| Setting | Model | Result | Notes |
|---------|-------|--------|-------|
| W4 SHARQ | OPT-125M | **~40.9 PPL** | Matches uniform BoA closely. This is the seed result. |
| W3 SHARQ (first attempt) | OPT-125M | 80.8 PPL | Failure. No-zero codebooks selected + narrow clip grid. |
| W3 SHARQ (fixed) | OPT-125M | **48.9 PPL** | After forcing zero-inclusive codebooks and widening clip grid to [0.50, 1.00]. |

OPT-125M is the smoke-test model. Nothing at scale has been run yet.

**The headline accuracy claim to defend:** SHARQ's W4 perplexity matches uniform W4 at the same protocol (W4A16, group 128), and the enable table recovers the accuracy that fixed codebooks lose at W3/W2.

